#. Description of the plugin
#: wpfonts.php
msgid "中文、英文、日文、韩文系统字体。文风云默认关闭，开启后每条已确认的文风云字体各加载一条样式。"
msgstr "System fonts for Chinese, English, Japanese, and Korean. Windfonts Cloud is off by default; once enabled, each confirmed Windfonts Cloud font loads its own stylesheet."

