msgstr "This shows the stylesheet address the front end will load."

#: includes/class-wpfonts-admin.php:640
msgid "简要说明。"
msgstr "Brief description."

#: includes/class-wpfonts-admin.php:644
msgid "编辑器与排版"
msgstr "Editor and typography"

#: includes/class-wpfonts-admin.php:645
msgid "侧栏里的「文派字库」作用于当前区块。已启用的文风字体包和已确认的文风云会进入全站样式，可在外观 → 样式 → 排版里选用。"
msgstr "The \"WenPai Fonts\" panel in the sidebar applies to the current block. Enabled Windfonts packages and confirmed Windfonts Cloud fonts also enter Global Styles, selectable under Appearance → Styles → Typography."

#: includes/class-wpfonts-admin.php:648
#: includes/class-wpfonts-admin.php:914
msgid "中文"
msgstr "Chinese"

#: includes/class-wpfonts-admin.php:649
msgid "未指定中文回退时，站点使用系统中文。安装文风字体包或开启文风云后，可在设置里指定正文、标题和中文回退。"
msgstr "Without a Chinese fallback the site uses system Chinese. After installing a Windfonts package or enabling Windfonts Cloud, you can set body, headings, and the Chinese fallback in settings."

#: includes/class-wpfonts-admin.php:653
msgid "打开即用。字体库里的「系统 · 中文」「系统 · 英文」「系统 · 日文」「系统 · 韩文」默认可用，前台直接使用设备字体。"
msgstr "Ready to use. The \"System · Chinese\", \"System · English\", \"System · Japanese\", and \"System · Korean\" entries in the Font Library are available by default; the front end uses device fonts directly."

#: includes/class-wpfonts-admin.php:656
#: includes/class-wpfonts-admin.php:964
#: includes/class-wpfonts-editor.php:68
#: includes/class-wpfonts-library.php:157
#: includes/class-wpfonts-schema.php:116
msgid "文风云"
msgstr "Windfonts Cloud"

#: includes/class-wpfonts-admin.php:657
msgid "默认关闭。开启并保存后，每条已确认的文风云字体各加一条样式链接。服务器只有 cn.windfonts.com、hk.windfonts.com 和 en.windfonts.com。网页中不会出现 API Key。"
msgstr "Off by default. Once enabled and saved, each confirmed Windfonts Cloud font adds one stylesheet link. Only cn.windfonts.com, hk.windfonts.com, and en.windfonts.com are used. The API Key never appears on the page."

#: includes/class-wpfonts-admin.php:660
#: includes/class-wpfonts-admin.php:963
#: includes/class-wpfonts-admin.php:1873
#: includes/class-wpfonts-schema.php:115
msgid "文风字体包"
msgstr "Windfonts font packages"

#: includes/class-wpfonts-admin.php:661
msgid "安装文风已切好的字体包，文件保存在本站，由本站直接加载。"
msgstr "Install font packages already subset by Windfonts. Files stay on this site and load directly."

#: includes/class-wpfonts-admin.php:664
msgid "字体目录"
msgstr "Font catalog"

#: includes/class-wpfonts-admin.php:665
msgid "目录保存在本站，每月自动更新一次；在设置里也可立即刷新。选中的字体会写入字体名。"
msgstr "The catalog is stored on this site and refreshes monthly; it can also be refreshed immediately in settings. Selected fonts are written to the font name field."

#: includes/class-wpfonts-admin.php:668
msgid "使用范围"
msgstr "Usage"

#: includes/class-wpfonts-admin.php:669
msgid "字体切分在文风侧完成，主题文件无需改动。已启用的文风字体包和确认能打开的文风云会出现在全站样式里；卸载插件时不删除全站样式。"
msgstr "Font subsetting happens on the Windfonts side; theme files need no changes. Enabled Windfonts packages and confirmed-reachable Windfonts Cloud fonts appear in Global Styles; uninstalling the plugin does not delete Global Styles."

#: includes/class-wpfonts-admin.php:699
msgid "文风字体包使用中。前台会加载本站这份字体样式。文风云仍可按需开启。"
msgstr "A Windfonts package is in use. The front end loads this site's copy. Windfonts Cloud can still be enabled when needed."

#: includes/class-wpfonts-admin.php:703
msgid "当前使用系统字体。要开启文风云，打开下方开关并保存；也可以先到字体包安装文风已切好的包。"
msgstr "System fonts are in use. To enable Windfonts Cloud, turn on the switch below and save; you can also install a Windfonts-ready package under Font packages first."

#: includes/class-wpfonts-admin.php:710
msgid "网页字体尚未开启"
msgstr "Web fonts are not enabled yet"

#: includes/class-wpfonts-admin.php:711
msgid "系统字体开箱即用。需要文风字体时，可开启文风云，或到字体包安装。"
msgstr "System fonts work out of the box. For Windfonts fonts, enable Windfonts Cloud or install a package under Font packages."

#: includes/class-wpfonts-admin.php:714
#: includes/class-wpfonts-admin.php:1588
msgid "去设置"
msgstr "Go to settings"

#: includes/class-wpfonts-admin.php:729
msgid "文风 API Key 尚未验证。请到工具中再检查一次。验证通过前，前台不加载样式。"
msgstr "The Windfonts API Key is not verified yet. Run the check again under Tools. Until it passes, the front end loads no styles."

#: includes/class-wpfonts-admin.php:731
msgid "文风云已开启，但尚未填写文风 API Key。请到设置页填写。前台暂不加载远程样式。"
msgstr "Windfonts Cloud is enabled, but no Windfonts API Key has been entered. Enter it on the settings page. The front end does not load remote styles for now."

#: includes/class-wpfonts-admin.php:734
#: includes/class-wpfonts-admin.php:1784
msgid "文风 API Key 无效，前台使用系统字体。"
msgstr "The Windfonts API Key is invalid; the front end uses system fonts."

#: includes/class-wpfonts-admin.php:736
msgid "这次未能连接，暂不判定 Key 状态。前台使用系统字体，请稍后再检查。"
msgstr "Could not connect this time, so the Key status is undetermined. The front end uses system fonts; check again later."

#: includes/class-wpfonts-admin.php:738
msgid "文风 API Key 可用。还需要字体名或项目名，前台暂不加载样式。"
msgstr "The Windfonts API Key works. A font name or project name is still needed before the front end loads styles."

#: includes/class-wpfonts-admin.php:741
#: includes/class-wpfonts-admin.php:1645
msgid "这条地址打不开，前台不会加载。换个字体，或改字符范围后再保存。"
msgstr "This address cannot be opened, so the front end will not load it. Try another font or change the subset and save again."

#: includes/class-wpfonts-admin.php:744
msgid "文风云已开启，文风 API Key 可用。前台会加载文风服务器上的样式，网页中不会出现 Key。"
msgstr "Windfonts Cloud is enabled and the Windfonts API Key works. The front end loads styles hosted on Windfonts servers; the Key never appears on the page."

#: includes/class-wpfonts-admin.php:746
msgid "文风字体包也在使用。"
msgstr "A Windfonts package is also in use."

