msgid "还没有可以选的中文。安装文风字体包或开启文风云并确认后，就能在这里指定中文回退。"
msgstr "No Chinese fonts are selectable yet. After installing a Windfonts package or enabling and confirming Windfonts Cloud, you can set the Chinese fallback here."

