msgstr "No file was read."

#: includes/class-wpfonts-admin.php:1028
msgid "导出"
msgstr "Export"

#: includes/class-wpfonts-admin.php:1028
msgid "下载不含 API Key 的 JSON，便于在另一站点恢复已启用的文风字体包和已确认的文风云。"
msgstr "Download a JSON without the API Key, for restoring enabled Windfonts packages and confirmed Windfonts Cloud fonts on another site."

#: includes/class-wpfonts-admin.php:1033
msgid "API Key 不会出现在文件中。"
msgstr "The API Key is not included in the file."

#: includes/class-wpfonts-admin.php:1034
