msgstr "Export JSON"

#: includes/class-wpfonts-admin.php:1037
msgid "导入"
msgstr "Import"

#: includes/class-wpfonts-admin.php:1037
msgid "写入已启用的字体包记录和已确认的文风云。本站没有对应文件的字体包会跳过。带密钥的文件会被拒绝。"
msgstr "Writes enabled font package records and confirmed Windfonts Cloud fonts. Packages without files on this site are skipped. Files containing secrets are refused."

#: includes/class-wpfonts-admin.php:1041
msgid "JSON 文件"
msgstr "JSON file"

#: includes/class-wpfonts-admin.php:1055
