msgstr "Mainland China"

#: includes/class-wpfonts-admin.php:1104
#: includes/class-wpfonts-schema.php:184
msgid "中国香港"
msgstr "Hong Kong"

#: includes/class-wpfonts-admin.php:1105
#: includes/class-wpfonts-schema.php:185
msgid "国际"
msgstr "International"

#: includes/class-wpfonts-admin.php:1110
#: includes/class-wpfonts-schema.php:180
msgid "区域"
msgstr "Region"

#: includes/class-wpfonts-admin.php:1112
#: includes/class-wpfonts-schema.php:181
msgid "选择文风云字体的 CDN 加速服务器。可选中国大陆、中国香港、国际三区域，香港节点兼顾国内外访问。"
msgstr "Choose the CDN server that accelerates Windfonts Cloud fonts. Three regions are available: Mainland China, Hong Kong, and International; the Hong Kong node serves both domestic and overseas visitors."

#: includes/class-wpfonts-admin.php:1139
#: includes/class-wpfonts-admin.php:1580
#: includes/class-wpfonts-schema.php:212
msgid "字符范围"
msgstr "Subset"

#: includes/class-wpfonts-admin.php:1150
#: includes/class-wpfonts-schema.php:213
msgid "字符范围决定远程字体包的大小，范围越小包越小。"
msgstr "The subset determines the remote font package size; smaller subsets produce smaller packages."

#: includes/class-wpfonts-admin.php:1162
#: includes/class-wpfonts-schema.php:215
msgid "西文"
msgstr "Latin"

#: includes/class-wpfonts-admin.php:1163
#: includes/class-wpfonts-schema.php:215
msgid "体积最小，主要覆盖拉丁字符。"
msgstr "Smallest size; covers mainly Latin characters."

#: includes/class-wpfonts-admin.php:1166
#: includes/class-wpfonts-schema.php:216
msgid "常用中文（推荐）"
msgstr "Common Chinese (recommended)"

#: includes/class-wpfonts-admin.php:1167
#: includes/class-wpfonts-schema.php:216
msgid "日常中文站点够用，体积适中。"
msgstr "Enough for everyday Chinese sites at a moderate size."

#: includes/class-wpfonts-admin.php:1170
#: includes/class-wpfonts-schema.php:217
msgid "较全中文"
msgstr "Extended Chinese"

#: includes/class-wpfonts-admin.php:1171
#: includes/class-wpfonts-schema.php:217
msgid "生僻字更多，体积明显更大。"
msgstr "More rare characters; noticeably larger."

